# Docker build context: keep private data, build outputs and large trees out.
# The Dockerfile only copies go.mod, go.sum, cmd, internal, web and
# deploy/server/healthcheck.
.git/
dist/
data/
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-*
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.exe
/airview
/airview.exe
/airview-feeder
docs/
build/
out/
*.log
